# Artifact bodies are language-specific payloads (JS / JSON / shell) embedded
# in `.md` for the Velite pipeline. Prettier treats them as Markdown prose and
# strips their indentation, so the source bytes diverge from what ships to
# `blink apply` consumers. Keep prettier away from them; bodies are hand-formatted.
**/*.artifact.md

# Next regenerates next-env.d.ts on every build with its own quoting/semicolons,
# so a prettier-normalized copy reverts and dirties the tree (and `format:check`)
# after any `next build` / `next dev`. Leave it as Next writes it.
**/next-env.d.ts

# Build output, lockfile, etc. Package `dist/` is ignored via nested
# .gitignore files, which prettier doesn't read — only the root one.
**/.velite/
**/.next/
**/.turbo/
**/dist/
pnpm-lock.yaml
